From dc9a6c471728175589589496f695259473c488af Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: logdog2325 <loganjayfisher@gmail.com>
Date: Fri, 24 Jul 2026 13:54:55 -0700
Subject: [PATCH 07/44] Android: Gen 3 team editor with Showdown and Pokepaste
 import

Ports the validated Emerald save library to Kotlin (sections, checksums,
party PK3 encode with substructure crypto), bundles vanilla Gen 3 data
tables generated from the pokeemerald decompilation, and adds a team
editor in the Pokemon Box-style theme: import a Showdown paste or a
pokepast.es link, build the party into the save Dolphin uses for
netplay, verify every write independently with automatic backups, and
share the save to the session host. Bundled template saves let it work
before any game has been played.
